# suppression-ban exclusion list — vendored trees only. Hand-written source
# is never excluded: every lint suppression there states its reason.
# Format: pattern<TAB>reason (gitignore-style against the repo-relative path; ** crosses /).

.agents/**	kendex's own render of skills/, agents/ and hooks/ — the SOURCE is governed by the rows below, so governing the mirror doubles every finding
.claude/skills/**	rendered skill links into .agents/skills
.claude/agents/**	kendex-rendered agent copies, source in agents/
.claude/hooks/**	kendex-rendered hook copies, source in hooks/
.codex/agents/**	kendex-rendered agent copies, source in agents/
.codex/hooks/**	kendex-rendered hook copies, source in hooks/
.pi/agents/**	kendex-rendered agent copies, source in agents/
.pi/kendex/hooks/**	kendex-rendered hook copies, source in hooks/
skills/iced-rs/**	vendored upstream iced source and examples bundled as the skill's API reference — upstream's allows are not this repo's to justify
